<title>SOUTH KOREA: TENNIS-S.KOREA AND JAPAN LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-S.KOREA AND JAPAN LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea and Japan were level 1-1 after Friday's opening singles matches in their Davis Cup Asia/Oceania zone group one first round tie.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Yoon Yong-il beat Takao Suzuki 1-6 7-5 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Lee Hyung-taek lost to Shuzo Matsuoka 0-3 3-6 6-7</p>
